    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Forever is the Sweetest Con</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Ten years apart. Another ten years in a life of being on the run perpetually. A familiar man approaches Adora with a difficult task she has little say in: round up her old gang members and turn them in. The people she grew up with. The woman who raised her. The woman she grew up alongside and loved for years and yearsâ€”they will all swing for their crimes. With heavy blackmail weighing her down, Adora must face the life that abandoned her a decade ago, desperately plotting a way to save the one she loves most in the process.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>stingingscorpion</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
